{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22013","headline":"寓意诗五首 四 · 白居易","name":"寓意诗五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩两玄鸟，本是同巢燕。\n分飞来几时，秋夏炎凉变。\n一宿蓬筚庐，一栖明光殿。\n偶因衔泥处，复得重相见。\n彼矜杏梁贵，此嗟茅栋贱。\n眼看秋社至，两处俱难恋。\n所托各暂时，胡爲相叹羡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}